304
00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:18.620
All right, then, I'll continue.

305
00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.960
There is, Nastenka, a certain hour of the

306
00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.200
day that I love more than any other.

307
00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.880
It's the hour when most people have finished

308
00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.620
