312
00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:39.140
At that hour, our hero—yes, allow me to

313
00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:42.200
speak about myself—in the third person, since it

314
00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.200
feels too embarrassing to tell it in the

315
00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.720
first person, would join the others heading home,

316
00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.220
but on his face, pale and a bit

317
00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:52.220
