330
00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:25.060
If you had seen him then, Nastenka, you

331
00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:27.180
would have noticed how joy flickered across his

332
00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.560
face, already affecting his sensitive nerves and overly

333
00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.600
vivid imagination.

334
00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.940
He wasn't thinking about dinner or the evening

335
00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.380
ahead.

