362
00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:41.640
A little girl stepping aside to avoid him,

363
00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.920
giggles at his distracted smile and odd gestures.

364
00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.680
But even these interruptions, Nastenka, are caught by

365
00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:52.860
his imagination and spun into the whimsical tapestry

366
00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:53.660
of his thoughts.

367
00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.880
When he finally returns to his quiet little

368
00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.840
den, his mind is overflowing with new impressions.

369
00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.560
Matrona, his sombre and dutiful housekeeper, clears away

370
00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:06.920
his dinner, which he barely remembers eating.

371
00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:08.960
