383
00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.800
His mind has already begun crafting a new

384
00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:41.340
world, filled with fresh adventures and delicate emotions.

385
00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.680
What does he care about real life, Nastenka?

386
00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:50.780
To him it seems dull, lifeless, slow—nothing like

387
00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.240
the vivid, enchanting world of his dreams.

388
00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:58.120
And yet, Nastenka, even as he loses himself

389
00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.620
