391
00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.320
moment of real, imperfect life.

392
00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:10.240
Perhaps he doesn't foresee it yet, but one

393
00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:12.620
day the hour may strike when he would

394
00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:15.120
