408
00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:52.940
There was a lump forming in my throat,

409
00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.800
my chin was beginning to quiver, and my

410
00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.240
eyes were slowly welling with tears that I

411
00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.400
struggled to hold back.

412
00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.260
I glanced at Nastenka, who had been listening

413
00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:05.460
