619
00:24:46.900 --> 00:24:50.820
Listen, she continued, her voice soft but filled

620
00:24:50.820 --> 00:24:51.480
with resolve.

621
00:24:51.880 --> 00:24:53.300
I'm just a simple girl.

622
00:24:53.960 --> 00:24:56.480
I haven't had much education, though Grandmother did

623
00:24:56.480 --> 00:24:58.080
hire a teacher for me for a while,

624
00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:01.400
but I do understand you, truly, I do.

625
00:25:02.060 --> 00:25:05.020
Everything you've just described, I felt it too.

626
00:25:05.780 --> 00:25:07.680
I went through the same thing when Grandmother

627
00:25:07.680 --> 00:25:09.280
pinned me to her dress to keep me

628
00:25:09.280 --> 00:25:09.980
by her side.

629
00:25:10.620 --> 00:25:14.140
Of course, she added shyly, a faint blush

630
00:25:14.140 --> 00:25:15.100
